    "created_at": "2016-12-02T05:42:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-12-02T05:42:31Z",
    "body": "OK I fixed the HTML parser code in https://github.com/validator/htmlparser/commit/520065e5f59872c91cce8f1dac5ef039f550fe0f and pushed that fix to https://checker.html5.org/\r\n\r\nFor `<!--<!--!>` https://checker.html5.org/parsetree/?parser=html5&content=%3C%21doctype+html%3E%0D%0A%3C%21--%3C%21--%21%3E&submit=Print+Tree now gives:\r\n\r\n```\r\n#document\r\n| <!DOCTYPE html>\r\n| <!-- <! -->\r\n| <html>\r\n|   <head>\r\n|   <body>\r\n#errors\r\n9: Saw “<!--” within a comment. Probable cause: Nested comment (not allowed).\r\n10: “--!>” found at end of comment (should just be “-->”).\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd for `<!--<!--!` https://checker.html5.org/parsetree/?parser=html5&content=%3C%21doctype+html%3E%0D%0A%3C%21--%3C%21--%21&submit=Print+Tree now gives:\r\n\r\n```\r\n#document\r\n| <!DOCTYPE html>\r\n| <!-- <! -->\r\n| <html>\r\n|   <head>\r\n|   <body>\r\n#errors\r\n9: Saw “<!--” within a comment. Probable cause: Nested comment (not allowed).\r\n9: End of file inside comment.\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
